@startuml

title Idea Bank - Propose Idea Activity Diagram

start

:Student opens Propose Idea page;

:Enter idea title;
:Enter description;
:Select domain;
:Enter technology stack;
:Select difficulty;

:Submit proposal;

:Validate input;

if (Input valid?) then (Yes)

    :Generate TF-IDF representation;
    :Calculate cosine similarity;
    :Find top 3 similar ideas;

    if (Similarity score > 0.8?) then (Yes)

        :Display similar ideas;

        if (Student wants to continue?) then (Yes)
            :Confirm proposal submission;
            :Create idea with PENDING status;
            :Save idea to database;
            :Show submission success;
        else (No)
            :Return to proposal form;
        endif

    else (No)

        :Create idea with PENDING status;
        :Save idea to database;
        :Show submission success;

    endif

else (No)

    :Display validation errors;
    :Return to proposal form;

endif

stop

@enduml